      "content": "For your detectives, consider the world-weary veteran who's seen too much, contrasted with the ambitious, rule-bending rookie from an underrepresented background. On the criminal side, you could feature a hyper-organized white-collar syndicate leader operating in shadows, juxtaposed with a street-level hustler who is trapped by their own desperation. This mix allows for both high-stakes procedural drama and intense human drama within the city's diverse landscape.",
